  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-pressure-context",
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "knowledgePointJa": "血圧は、血液が動脈の壁に及ぼす圧力です。心臓が収縮して血液を送り出すときの値を収縮期血圧、拍動の間に心臓が拡張するときの値を拡張期血圧といいます。最大血圧・最小血圧という呼び方は、一つの心拍の中の二つの値を区別するものです。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_editorial_limits",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        50,
        51
      ],
      "pdfPages": [
        52,
        53
      ],
      "pageMappingStatus": "printed_labels_checked_in_text_and_rendered_pages",
      "verificationStatus": "ai_source_comparison_only",
      "corroboratingSourceIds": [
        "nhlbi-measurement"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "domainReviewed": false,
      "nativeReviewed": false
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-pressure-context",
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "knowledgePointJa": "収縮期の値を「高血圧という病気」、拡張期の値を「低血圧という病気」と読み替えてはいけません。二つの値は一組で記録し、病気の評価とは区別します。この学習では診断に用いる数値の基準を新たに定めません。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_editorial_limits",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        50,
        51
      ],
      "pdfPages": [
        52,
        53
      ],
      "pageMappingStatus": "printed_labels_checked_in_text_and_rendered_pages",
      "verificationStatus": "ai_source_comparison_only",
      "corroboratingSourceIds": [
        "nhlbi-measurement"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "domainReviewed": false,
      "nativeReviewed": false
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "kaigo-atomic-pressure-context",
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "knowledgePointJa": "血圧は一日の中でも変動します。姿勢、活動、心の状態、病気の有無などが影響するため、一回の値を一日中変わらない値とは考えません。測った時刻、姿勢、測定前の活動など、わかる条件を一緒に残します。",
      "evidenceType": "source_concept_independent_expression_with_editorial_limits",
      "source": {
        "document": "介護ー特定技能ーベトナム語.pdf",
        "edition": "second revision March 2025",
        "sha256": "997bf386ba8344e19c644c3cbd6ae2d40760bfb32ed882db999ad8e17068aa54"
      },
      "printedPages": [
        50,
